{
  "_comment": "VI DU MAU — xoa file nay khi project that bat dau. Giu de lam ban tham chieu duy nhat cho kernel/contracts/screen-layout.schema.json (truoc day thu muc nay rong, khong co vi du nao doi chieu). Trung quy uoc US-000 dang dung o shared/PRD.md va shared/contracts/domain-map.json.",
  "_demonstrates": "Man danh sach san pham e-commerce: 4 state (loading/success/empty/error), card duoc BE thanh tung phan ben trong qua field parent (card -> card_img/card_name/card_price) de moi phan kiem duoc rieng, moi bind co on_null, moi text co text_overflow, state loi co recovery_action + nut retry tro ve state ton tai that. state 'loaded' co 0 primary — HOP LE va co y: man danh sach khong nen nang 1 card len tren cac card khac (xem design_patterns/e-commerce-marketplace muc 2). Va: moi khoi chua khai `responsive` (2 cot o bac < 600dp theo M3 compact, anh card giu ti le 1:1, min_height_dp = null vi khoi co chua text) + `responsive_declared` o goc — day la lop chan 'layout vo o may 320dp / o co chu he thong 200%'.",
